# Sound: tunes with and without a key, an arpeggio, held notes, a blip in a
# melody, blips on a sprite and an item, {tune} and {blip} in dialog, and an
# exit transition. Each line in the trace is a frame where a channel changed.
game ../games/sound.bitsy
trace output
read                         # title; tune 1 plays
press right                  # the cat: its blip pauses the tune
read
press left                   # the bell: item blip
press right down             # exit with fade_w into room 1; tune 2 with an arpeggio
press right                  # {tune "3"}
read
press right                  # {tune "0"}
read
press right                  # {blip "3"}, a repeating blip
read
press right                  # {tune "2"}
read
press right                  # {blip "4"}: BEAT 0 0 plays the last pitch
read
press right                  # {blip "5"}: BEAT 0 0 with repeat has no pitch
read
